{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":24,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"a31821dc-ecdd-465d-b596-494820d6550a","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":311162008,"PostDateInt":1784180064000,"PostDate":"2026-07-16T13:34:24","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"生物医药大模型算法专家(J12606)","OrgId":4001951,"Org":"LS LLM","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市","江苏省·苏州市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"【团队与岗位愿景】\n在这里，你将参与构建生物医药大模型与知识推理系统，用最前沿的 AI 技术解决新药研发与生命科学领域的真实痛点。\n\n【核心职责】\n1、领域大模型研发与优化：负责生物医药大模型的垂直优化，包含语料构建、指令微调、RAG/GraphRAG 结合及工具调用，提升模型在复杂科学场景下的推理准确度与可信度（降低幻觉）。\n2、多模态科学文档理解：研发面向论文、专利等多模态文档（文本、表格、图表、分子式等）的解析算法，实现复杂科学信息的高精度结构化提取。\n3、生化实体抽取与知识挖掘：设计优化的 NER、RE 和实体链接模型，构建跨模态信息抽取 pipeline，实现多粒度实体（靶点、疾病、化合物等）及构效关系（SAR）、ADMET 信息的精准抽取与关联。\n4、算法工程落地：构建高性能的 AI 推理与数据处理服务，推动算法能力在海量专利、文献及真实药物研发业务中的高效落地。","Require":"【任职资格】\n1. 背景与经验\n- 计算机、人工智能、计算生物学、化学信息学等相关专业博士学历（具备丰富工业界落地经验的优秀硕士亦可）。\n- 具备 AI4Science、生物医药知识图谱、医疗/科学大模型、AIDD 等相关方向的研发经验。\n2. 核心技术栈（满足部分即可）\n- 大模型/深度学习：精通 Transformer 架构，有 LLM / VLM 的训练、微调（LoRA等）及部署经验；精通 PyTorch 及大规模分布式训练。\n- NLP/多模态：熟悉信息抽取（NER/RE）、长文本建模、RAG 架构或多模态文档解析（OCR/图文对齐）。\n- 化学/生物信息学：熟悉大分子/小分子表示方法（SMILES、三维构象等），熟练使用 RDKit 等工具处理分子数据者优先。\n3. 行业理解力\n- 具备良好的生物医药/化学基础知识（如靶点机制、PK/PD等），能与业务领域的科学家高效跨频沟通。\n- 熟悉常用的生化公开数据库（如 ChEMBL、PubChem、UniProt、PDB 等）。\n\n【加分项】\n- 在顶会/顶刊发表过高质量论文，或有知名开源项目贡献者优先。\n- 有实际的工业级生物医药大模型、智能药物发现平台、复杂专利/文献挖掘系统落地经验。\n- 熟悉 BioBERT/ChemBERTa/AlphaFold 等生态圈，或有图神经网络（GNN）、分子生成相关经验。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-16T13:34:24","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"c2db185f-aea8-4bfe-8f63-dd3624f2e143","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":311202490,"PostDateInt":1794808504000,"PostDate":"2026-11-16T13:55:04","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"拓展销售(J12789)","OrgId":3965796,"Org":"拓展团队","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市","上海市"],"Salary":"10K-15K 元/月","Duty":"1","Require":"1","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-16T13:55:04","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"c5e109be-6186-4d4d-9e93-6d5f4f9ca7aa","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":311199392,"PostDateInt":1793691667000,"PostDate":"2026-11-03T15:41:07","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"生物医药领域专家（AI 评估方向）(J12779)","OrgId":4046442,"Org":"黄金数据集","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市"],"Salary":"25K-30K 元/月","Duty":"1. 围绕小分子化药与大分子生物药，从靶点识别、药物发现、苗头化合物筛选、先导化合物优化，到临床前研究、临床试验设计与执行等核心研发场景，系统化输出领域知识框架与专业判断逻辑。\n2. 将资深生物医药专家在药物研发各环节中沉淀的判断标准与专业直觉，转化为结构化、可被清晰描述与复现的规则化表达。包括但不限于：\n靶点维度：靶点可成药性评估、靶点-疾病关联强度、生物学合理性的判定逻辑；DDTM（药物适应症靶点作用机制）的合理性评判标准；\n分子设计维度：SAR（构效关系）解读规范、分子优化方向的优先级判断、骨架跃迁合理性评估；LCA（先导化合物推荐）的判定依据与分级标准；\n成药性维度：ADMET（吸收、分布、代谢、排泄、毒性）各维度的风险分级与权衡逻辑；\n结构与机制维度：蛋白质结构预测结果的可靠性评判、结合模式合理性、共晶体结构解读规范；\n大分子特性维度：抗体/蛋白工程的成药性判断、免疫原性风险评估、稳定性与可生产性权衡；\n临床维度：临床方案合理性、终点选择、统计假设的判断要素。\n3. 对生物医药AI产品的评估体系中涉及生物医药专业性的关键环节进行专业审定，包括评测样本的科学严谨性与代表性、评分标准是否符合行业共识、争议性边界 case 的专业裁决。在专业判断分歧出现时，提供具有医药行业公信力的最终意见。\n4. 基于评估暴露的AI产品能力短板，从医药研发视角解读问题的本质及领域知识补强的优先方向，形成\"评估发现问题—领域洞察反哺—模型能力进化\"的闭环输入。","Require":"1. 硕士及以上学历，药物化学、药理学、分子生物学、生物化学、化学生物学、生物信息学或相关专业背景；博士优先。\n2. 5 年以上生物医药研发实战经验，在小分子化药或大分子生物药至少一个方向具备深度积淀，独立或核心参与过完整研发项目。\n3. 在以下至少一个领域具备深度专长：靶点发现与验证、药物化学与分子设计、ADMET 评价与成药性优化、蛋白质结构生物学、计算化学与计算生物学、抗体/蛋白工程、ADC/双抗/多肽/核酸药物等大分子方向、临床前药理毒理、临床试验设计与转化医学。\n4. 熟悉 SAR、ADMET、靶点识别、DDTM、LCA、蛋白质结构预测等核心方法论与工具体系的应用边界与实务标准。\n5. 具备将医药专家隐性经验显性化、结构化的能力，善于运用分级标准、判断梯度、维度组合、决策树、风险矩阵等结构化方式表达专业判断，而非仅依赖案例叙述。\n6. 具备良好的跨专业沟通能力，能够与产品、算法研发团队就领域问题进行高效协同与共建。对 AI、计算药物设计、AI for Science 在医药研发中的应用持开放态度，认同领域专业经验通过标准化沉淀实现规模化复用的价值。\n加分项\n1. 具备 AIDD相关项目经验，或对 AlphaFold、RFdiffusion、扩散模型在分子设计中的应用具备认知。\n2. 在 ADC、双特异性抗体、CGT、mRNA、PROTAC 等前沿模态有实战经验。\n3. 有发表高水平学术论文或参与行业指南/标准制定经历。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-03T15:41:07","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"f4c77105-3383-479a-8134-e497b13eeb9d","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":311198558,"PostDateInt":1793350569000,"PostDate":"2026-10-30T16:56:09","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"平台产品专家(J12775)","OrgId":4046391,"Org":"应用产品部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市","江苏省·苏州市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"岗位职责\n1. 负责智慧芽应用平台的产品规划与落地，围绕 AI 应用构建、ChatBot 和开放平台，设计从创建、调试到发布的完整体验。\n2. 推进 Vibe Coding Builder 产品能力，研究并实践 Claude Code（CC）、Codex 等工具的使用方式，将真实项目经验转化为产品方案。\n3. 设计模型与应用的集成能力，包括 MCP、Harness、Agent System 和 Context 管理，推动相关能力在平台中落地。\n4. 与研发、设计及业务团队协作，明确需求优先级，推动产品迭代，并根据用户反馈持续优化。","Require":"任职要求\n1. 有 3–5 年产品经理经验；具备 AI 应用平台、开发者工具、ChatBot 或开放平台相关经验。\n2. 有 Vibe Coding Builder 实践，能够展示使用 Claude Code、Codex 完成的具体项目案例，并讲清楚自己的设计判断与实际贡献。\n3. 理解模型应用的关键设计问题，对 MCP、Harness、Agent System、Context 设计有实际项目经验或深入实践。\n4. 逻辑清晰，能快速学习新技术并转化为可用的产品能力；主动协作、低 ego，愿意听取反馈并持续改进。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-30T16:56:09","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null}],"Total":0}